# NVLink / NVSwitch intra-server domain for the 128-GPU rail cluster.
#
#   16 servers x 8 GPUs. Tier 0 leaf = ONE server's NVSwitch: 8 GPUs on a single
#   3600 Gbps non-blocking crossbar (same NVLink figure as the existing
#   shared/topos_h100/nvlink_1024gpu_8pergpu.topo). Consecutive attachment (NO
#   "Rails" line): leaf s owns GPUs 8s..8s+7 = one server.
#
#   Only intra-server flows are attached to this topology, so traffic never
#   leaves a leaf; Tier 1 exists only because htsim needs >= 2 tiers (inert).
Nodes 128
Tiers 2
Podsize 128

Tier 0
Oversubscribed 8
Downlink_speed_Gbps 3600
Radix_Down 8
Radix_Up 1
Downlink_Latency_ns 100
Switch_Latency_ns 0

Tier 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 3600
Radix_Down 16
Downlink_Latency_ns 100
Switch_Latency_ns 0
Bundle 1
